stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Unmatched
  Unmatched --> Suggested : few frames match, tag Name?
  Unmatched --> Confident : enough frames match
  Suggested --> Confident : stronger match later
  Suggested --> Confirmed : user adds tag Name
  Confident --> Rejected : user removes the tag
  Confident --> Rejected : user removes the person in People
  Suggested --> Rejected : user removes tag Name?
  Confident --> [*]
  Confirmed --> [*]
  Rejected --> [*]
  note right of Confident : tag Name, People-page link, album entry
  note right of Rejected : never added again, tool takes its own tag back
  note right of Confirmed : the user's own tag is never touched
